cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DCR in your work, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "DCR — Dexoron Cargo Realization"
abstract: >-
  DCR is a Cargo-style build tool and dependency manager for C and C++ projects.
  It builds, runs, and tests projects from a single dcr.toml, supports path, Git,
  registry, and pkg-config dependencies, workspaces, cross-compilation,
  multiple assemblers, and IDE integration.
